.TP
.BI "images" " dedupe FILE [-o OUT]"
Merge pictures the file stores twice
.TP
.BI "images" " extract FILE --out-dir DIR"
Write the stored pictures out as they are
.TP
.BI "images" " limitations"
What working on pictures cannot promise
.TP
.BI "images" " list FILE"
Every picture, with the resolution it really has
.TP
.BI "images" " remove FILE --resource RES"
Stop a page drawing one
.TP
.BI "images" " replace FILE --with PIC"
Put another picture in the same place
.TP
.BI "images" " resample FILE --max-dpi N"
