.TP
.BI "set-version" " FILE [-o OUT]"
Set the PDF version the header claims
.TP
.BI "tables" " FILE"
Show the tables it can find, and how sure it is
.TP
.BI "to-csv" " FILE"
[-o OUT]           Write those tables out as comma-separated values
.TP
.BI "to-html" " FILE"
[-o OUT]         Read the words back out as one HTML file
.TP
.BI "to-markdown" " FILE"
[-o OUT]         Read the words back out as Markdown
.TP
.BI "to-pdfx" " FILE"
[-o OUT]           Convert to PDF/X for a commercial printer
.TP
.BI "to-svg" " FILE"
[-o TMPL]          Draw each page as an SVG file
.TP
.BI "to-text" " FILE"
[-o OUT]         Read the words back out as plain text
.TP
.BI "typeset" " FILE|-"
[-o OUT]         Set a text or Markdown file as pages
